==English==

===Etymology===
From {{Gd.}} ''[[gall]]''  "foreigner" or "stranger".  

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[family name]]; [[foreigner]], [[stranger]], i.e. (''Ireland'') a person from Wales or England who [[immigrate]]d after the Norman invasion, or (''Scotland'') a person from [[Scandinavia]] or the English-speaking lowlands.

